  "description": "“Soho Baek” is the sole survivor of his clan when they are killed after falsely being accused of treason. Brought to the imperial palace to act as the emperor’s curse bearer, he spends his days in loneliness and pain. When Prince “Jugyul,” now the only remaining son of the emperor, appears in front of him and showers him with kindness, Soho can’t help but fall in love. Can true love genuinely exist in the imperial palace, or does Prince Jugyul have something else up his sleeve?\n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
